# ============================================================================
# Versandkostenretter — HTTP access guard for docs/
#
# Documentation is part of the repository and therefore part of the deployment
# directory (document root = repository root), but it must NEVER be served
# over HTTP. This rule denies the ENTIRE directory for any file type —
# current documentation (.md) and any future artefacts (.txt, .json, diagrams,
# images, ...).
#
# The global root .htaccess additionally blocks sensitive file types
# (incl. .md) everywhere; this file is the directory-level defense-in-depth
# layer. The HTTP exposure suite (tests/check_http_exposure.php) proves the
# blocking over real HTTP.
# ============================================================================

Require all denied
